      "updated": 1787855211857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ul -> li ?\n\naria live on carousel div & aria-hidden on hidden slides\n\ntitle for carousel -> tem que ser uma region afinal\n\ntablist for thumbnail navigation\n\n<div class=\"carousel\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Slideshow\" aria-live=\"polite\"> ...\n</div>\n\n\naria current no botão correspondente ao slide\n\n.carousel {\n  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n}\n\n.carousel-item {\n  scroll-snap-align: start;\n}\n\n\nSe for um carousel com páginas discretas use role tabpanel e não use aria-live\npolite. Use truque co mview.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ul -> li ?\n\naria live on carousel div & aria-hidden on hidden slides\n\ntitle for carousel -> tem que ser uma region afinal\n\ntablist for thumbnail navigation\n\n<div class=\"carousel\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Slideshow\" aria-live=\"polite\"> ... </div>\n\n\naria current no botão correspondente ao slide\n\n.carousel {\n  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n}\n\n.carousel-item {\n  scroll-snap-align: start;\n}\n\n\nSe for um carousel com páginas discretas use role tabpanel e não use aria-live polite. Use truque co mview.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
